  "description_html": "Skeletal diagram of <i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Akidostropheus\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Akidostropheus\">Akidostropheus oligos</a></i> showing known fossil material of the holotype (<b>PEFO 49132</b>) and referred (<b>PEFO 55418</b>, <b>49131</b>, <b>48152</b>) specimens. All specimens scale to individuals of a comparable size. Scale bar=5 cm.\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Key\">Key</h3></div>\n<p><b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#FFFFFF\" title=\"#FFFFFF\"> </b>=Holotype <small style=\"font-size:85%;\">(PEFO 49132)</small> and paratypes <small style=\"font-size:85%;\">(PEFO 55418, 49131, 48152)</small><br>\n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#8C8C8C\" title=\"#8C8C8C\"> </b>=Unknown\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"References\">References</h3></div>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.18476%2Fpale.v18.a5\">\"A diverse assemblage of tanystropheid archosauromorphs from the continental interior of Late Triassic Pangea includes a new taxon (<i>Akidostropheus oligos</i> gen. et sp. nov.)\"</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.ldeo.columbia.edu/~polsen/nbcp/olsen_tany_79.pdf\">\"A New Aquatic Eosuchian from the Newark Supergroup (Late Triassic-Early Jurassic) of North Carolina and Virginia\"</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/260512712_THE_MIDDLE-LATE_TRIASSIC_TETRAPOD_FOOTPRINT_ICHNOGENUS_GWYNEDDICHNIUM\">\"The Middle–Late Triassic tetrapod footprint ichnogenus <i>Gwyneddichnium</i>\"</a></li></ul>",
